description:
Implement `useSpring` — a hook that animates a number toward a target value using spring physics (stiffness + damping) via `requestAnimationFrame`.

**Example:**
```tsx
const x = useSpring(targetX, { stiffness: 0.1, damping: 0.8 });
// x smoothly follows targetX with spring motion
```

